WEBVTT

00:01:28.796 --> 00:01:31.636
that gave me the strength
to prove them wrong.

00:01:31.676 --> 00:01:34.796
But how does someone like me,
with a small group of partners,

00:01:34.836 --> 00:01:37.196
take on the big banks and insurers?

00:01:37.796 --> 00:01:41.036
Well, we start by making smart demands.

00:01:41.076 --> 00:01:43.516
Then we incentivize action.

00:01:44.036 --> 00:01:47.956
And finally, we add
a spoonful of blackmail

00:01:47.956 --> 00:01:50.916
that I like to think of
as a friendly nudge.

00:01:50.956 --> 00:01:52.516
(Laughter)

00:01:53.076 --> 00:01:56.556
When we set out to solve
the issues of the world,

00:01:56.596 --> 00:01:58.796
we might want too much at once.

00:01:58.796 --> 00:02:00.596
The end of poverty,